


>> CoffeeMachine := বস্তু নতুন.
CoffeeMachine যখন: ['order:'] করো: { :id
	>> coffee := ['Americano'].
	( id = 1 ) সত্য-হলে: {
		coffee := ['Cappuccino'].
	}.
	( id = 2 ) সত্য-হলে: {
		coffee := ['Espresso'].
	}.
	( id = 3 ) সত্য-হলে: {
		coffee := ['Latte'].
	}. <- coffee.
}.
>> SimpleCoffeeMachine := বস্তু নতুন.
SimpleCoffeeMachine যখন: ['order'] করো: { <- ['Black']. }.
>> redCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
আউটপুট লেখো: redCup, নতুন-লাইন.
redCup := ['Tea']. 
>> greenCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
আউটপুট লেখো: greenCup, নতুন-লাইন.
>> yellowCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
আউটপুট লেখো: yellowCup, নতুন-লাইন.
>> blueCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
আউটপুট লেখো: blueCup, নতুন-লাইন.
>> plasticCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
plasticCup := ['Lemonade']. 
>> blackCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
আউটপুট লেখো: blackCup, নতুন-লাইন.
blackCup শেষে-যোগ: [' nooo.... beer. '].
>> orangeCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
আউটপুট লেখো: orangeCup, নতুন-লাইন.
